.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-test-replay 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-test\-replay \- Run each modified test\*(Aqs base form against HEAD; a changed expectation is admitted only by a recorded answer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten test replay\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-base\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run each modified test\*(Aqs base form against HEAD; a changed expectation is admitted only by a recorded answer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-base\fR \fI<base>\fR
The revision this checkout is diffed against
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
